<h1>Wheelhouse</h1>

<p>Someone asked to reset the password of your Wheelhouse account, <%= @user.email_address %>.</p>

<p>
  You can choose a new password on
  <%= link_to "this password reset page", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %>.

  This link will expire in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.
</p>

<p>If it was not you, ignore this email. Your password stays the same.</p>
